{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Kaltrina Krasniqi (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, when director <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaltrina_Krasniqi\" title=\"Kaltrina Krasniqi\">Kaltrina Krasniqi</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> first read the script of <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vera_Dreams_of_the_Sea\" title=\"Vera Dreams of the Sea\">Vera Dreams of the Sea</a></b></i>, she was shocked at the similarities between its lead character and her own mother?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaltrina_Krasniqi","retrieved":1790245381546},{"title":"a FIFA youth tournament's final match (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a Ghanaian player was told not to take off his jersey during <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2009_FIFA_U-20_World_Cup_final\" title=\"2009 FIFA U-20 World Cup final\">a FIFA youth tournament's final match</a></b> because his physique made him look older than the tournament's age bracket?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2009_FIFA_U-20_World_Cup_final","retrieved":1790245381548},{"title":"Amadu Bansang Jobarteh (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amadu_Bansang_Jobarteh\" title=\"Amadu Bansang Jobarteh\">Amadu Bansang Jobarteh</a></b> was called a \"library\" of African history by Gambian politician <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sidia_Jatta\" title=\"Sidia Jatta\">Sidia Jatta</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amadu_Bansang_Jobarteh","retrieved":1790245381551},{"title":"Wang Wang and Fu Ni (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that 175 families helped to plant bamboo in <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wang_Wang_and_Fu_Ni\" title=\"Wang Wang and Fu Ni\">Wang Wang and Fu Ni</a></b><span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">'</span>s</span> enclosure at <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adelaide_Zoo\" title=\"Adelaide Zoo\">Adelaide Zoo</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wang_Wang_and_Fu_Ni","retrieved":1790245381553},{"title":"Ephraim Kishon (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Holocaust survivor <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ephraim_Kishon\" title=\"Ephraim Kishon\">Ephraim Kishon</a></b> had to play chess \"well enough to stay alive but not so well that the commandant would kill him in a moment of anger\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ephraim_Kishon","retrieved":1790245381556},{"title":"seaplane carriers in China (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that six different ships were used as <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_seaplane_carriers_of_China\" title=\"List of seaplane carriers of China\">seaplane carriers in China</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_seaplane_carriers_of_China","retrieved":1790245381558},{"title":"Gelimer (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Vandal king <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gelimer\" title=\"Gelimer\">Gelimer</a></b> repeated the phrase \"vanity of vanities, all is vanity\" during his retirement of his royal rights before the Byzantine emperor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Justinian_I\" title=\"Justinian I\">Justinian&nbsp;I</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gelimer","retrieved":1790245381559},{"title":"Canadian Association of Stand-up Comedians (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canadian_Association_of_Stand-up_Comedians\" title=\"Canadian Association of Stand-up Comedians\">Canadian Association of Stand-up Comedians</a></b> has lobbied to have stand-up comedy recognized as an art form?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canadian_Association_of_Stand-up_Comedians","retrieved":1790245381561},{"title":"Francis Clifford Smith (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_Clifford_Smith\" title=\"Francis Clifford Smith\">Francis Clifford Smith</a></b> was in prison in nine different decades?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_Clifford_Smith","retrieved":1790245381562},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;St. John's&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;BannerStJohns1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Colourful houses and military history await you in Canada's oldest and easternmost city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.